{
 "encounter_id": "00980",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. I have no complaints at all, I'm here for my annual health check, and I'd like blood tests, as I've read it's sensible after forty."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is sensible. Let me start with some questions. How are you in yourself? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very well, honestly. A few small things. I sometimes get mild heartburn after spicy food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Perhaps once a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My lower back is a little stiff when I wake up. It goes after a shower."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Energy levels?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. A bit tired by the evening, but I work long hours."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A multivitamin, a little yellow capsule, from the pharmacy. I forget its name. And vitamin C, maybe 500 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. And what do you do for a living?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a software architect. Desk-bound, I'm afraid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Blood pressure 126 over 78, pulse 68, weight 72 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's good, isn't it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very good. I'm going to feel your tummy.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go ahead. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft and not tender."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the muscles of your lower back are a bit tight on both sides."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the stiffness. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Overall you're in good shape. I think you're healthy for your age, with only minor, easily managed complaints."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's what I hoped. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "For the heartburn, I'd like to start omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day, before breakfast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "For how long? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A month, and we'll see. And for the back, I'd suggest paracetamol, 1 gram, when it's stiff."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I rarely take anything. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Only when you need it. Now the tests. I'd like to arrange a full blood count with liver and kidney function, and a cholesterol and HbA1c test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need to fast? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "For the cholesterol, yes, from midnight. Water is fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And stretch your back for a few minutes each morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the heartburn isn't better in four weeks, come back and see me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
